0..79 Comment "// The secret the far site\'s host proves its key with, as a model of `Secrets`."
80..82 Comment "//"
83..161 Comment "// A site\'s file names its secret and never holds it. The host reads the value"
162..240 Comment "// through a model of its own. The secret stays in the hosting process, out of"
241..275 Comment "// every file a deployment shares."
276..278 Comment "//"
279..352 Comment "// `gandr host --secrets` given this file applies `Secrets.secret` to the"
353..428 Comment "// site\'s secret name. The answer is a sealed `Secret.T`. The host reads it"
429..508 Comment "// whole, and no run prints it or ships it to a world. This model answers every"
509..585 Comment "// name with the two-process test\'s host secret, which proves the far site\'s"
586..593 Comment "// key."
594..596 Comment "//"
597..670 Comment "// - see: `two-processes.site.gandr` — the site naming the secret `far`"
671..738 Comment "// - see: `library/std/src/secret.gandr` — `Secret` and `Secrets`"
739..809 Comment "// - see: `crates/surface-driver/tests/net.rs` — the host reading it"
811..863 Comment "// The secret theory, from `std.secret` by its path."
